    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Tool to Add a Google Drive File to Vector DB\n\n### Changes from original:\n- **Fix #1**: Polling bumped to every 5 minutes (was every minute)\n- **Fix #2**: Switch now has explicit text/csv case before fallback\n- **Fix #3**: Tabular branch now feeds into Supabase vectorstore after schema update\n- **Fix #4**: Summarize → Set Schema → Update Schema → Vectorstore (sequential, no race)\n- **Fix #5**: Error handler node added; notifies on workflow failure\n- **Fix #6**: Delete filter uses `eq` not `like` for exact file_id match\n- **Fix #7**: Character Text Splitter explicitly set to 800 chars / 160 overlap\n- **Fix #8**: Session ID falls back to a UUID if missing\n- **Fix #9**: System prompt hardened with citation, tool order, and structured fallback rules",
        "height": 867,
        "width": 3073,
        "color": 5
